<title>UK: SOCCER-ENGLISH PREMIER LEAGUE GOALSCORERS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ENGLISH PREMIER LEAGUE GOALSCORERS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading goalscorers in the</p>
<p>English premier league after Saturday's matches:</p>
<p>20 - Alan  Shearer (Newcastle)</p>
<p>18 - Ian Wright (Arsenal)</p>
<p>14 - Dwight York (Aston Villa)</p>
<p>13 - Fabrizio Ravanelli (Middlesbrough), Robbie Fowler</p>
<p>(Liverpool), Les Ferdinand Newcastle)</p>
<p>12 - Ole Gunnar Solskjaer (Manchester United), Matthew</p>
<p>Le Tissier (Southampton)</p>
